  },
  {
   "key": "theme_desc_zh",
   "value": "有时候，一首原创歌诞生时没有方向，也没有公式。在这个舞台上，我们不再担心未来，只为此刻热爱的东西而演奏。没有人能决定音乐应该是什么样子。|音乐是一场没有终点的接力。小草颂的传承从未停止，我们把火花一届一届传下去。|没有边界，就没有什么能定义我们；没有什么定义我们，所以一切皆有可能。",
   "说明": "主题介绍，| 分段"
  },
  {
   "key": "theme_desc_en",
   "value": "Sometimes an original song is born with no direction in mind and no formula to follow. On this stage, we stop worrying about the future and play for what we love right now. No one gets to decide what music should sound like.|Music is an endless relay. The legacy of LGM is a journey that never stops. We pass the spark from one generation to the next, again and again.|Without boundaries, there is nothing to be defined by. Nothing defines us, so anything is possible.",
   "说明": ""
  },
